<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Chicago raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Chicago raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said on Wednesday it had raised its recommendation for First Chicago NBD Corp to market outperform from perform.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment. -- The company's stock was up 1/8 to 48-3/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
